{
    "word": "vociferation",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "54fca156-b42c-3421-b44c-5b993acbc2a5",
                "word": "vociferation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "de6cf9c6-2729-4ecc-8545-d73a4ff777ef",
                        "entry_id": "54fca156-b42c-3421-b44c-5b993acbc2a5",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "vociferations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fab2e63b-fe7d-335d-887d-89197c596c95",
                        "entry_id": "54fca156-b42c-3421-b44c-5b993acbc2a5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of exclaiming; violent outcry; vehement utterance of the voice."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f3a299f-42cb-4cb9-821e-67fce7aac4ef",
                                "sense_id": "fab2e63b-fe7d-335d-887d-89197c596c95",
                                "text": "And as she apprehended the boy's life was in danger, she screamed ten times louder than before; and indeed Master Blifil himself now seconded her with all the vociferation in his power."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb636166-eafd-4654-970a-ff5b8d1d669a",
                                "sense_id": "fab2e63b-fe7d-335d-887d-89197c596c95",
                                "text": "Crack go the whips; but twenty Patriot arms have seized each of the eight bridles: there is rearing, rocking, vociferation; not the smallest headway."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c7776f28-be0d-4cd2-8ff0-2265540d2804",
                        "source_entry_id": "54fca156-b42c-3421-b44c-5b993acbc2a5",
                        "source_sense_id": "fab2e63b-fe7d-335d-887d-89197c596c95",
                        "source_sense_description": "act of exclaiming; violent outcry",
                        "target_lang_word": "vocifération",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vocifération",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c9cc404f-8327-36e6-9b42-c085de3ecb35",
                                        "entry_id": "82b553dc-b06e-33a6-bb43-9f37862cee96",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Parole accompagnée de clameurs, exprimées avec colère."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83bf8553-55d0-41fe-9885-692a6a40cc23",
                                                "sense_id": "c9cc404f-8327-36e6-9b42-c085de3ecb35",
                                                "text": "Nous descendîmes, l’Anglais et moi, dans un autre canot, au milieu des vociférations menaçantes de nos adversaires."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68afa566-1f03-463a-91ac-76b2a8454542",
                                                "sense_id": "c9cc404f-8327-36e6-9b42-c085de3ecb35",
                                                "text": "Au fond, vers le Louvre, tout bouillonnait ; des flux énormes de foule, puis des reflux soudains ; des regards furieux ; des multitudes qui se disloquaient, se formaient en bandes d'où jaillissaient des vociférations qui crépitaient sur le murmure immense."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1f0e040-69bb-41db-90e6-e0837af9a410",
                                                "sense_id": "c9cc404f-8327-36e6-9b42-c085de3ecb35",
                                                "text": "L’aviateur, dans l’embrasure des portes, les domine de sa haute taille ; sa bouche, éloquente cavité sous une grosse moustache noire, est distendue par les vociférations qu’il s’époumone à lancer vers ces intrépides serviteurs de la Renommée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
